#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This dataset is a duplicate of the Main Loop Path dataset in the Mcity category in the Path: X-Y Coordinates library.
#
#The data was then modified to cause the vehicle to exit the roadway and travel over an uneven part of the terrain before returning to the road.
#
#The modification is a linear interpolation between the edge of the path on the large traffic circle and a point partially along the main street roadway.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

